--TEST--
a file is loaded once and every site that names it is a link, so a second `require` of it underlines too, `rule:statements/require-is-the-only-inclusion-construct`
--FILE--
<?nvs
require 'lib.nvs';
require 'lib.nvs';
--FILE lib.nvs--
<?nvs
class Counter { }
--REQUEST--
documentLink
--EXPECT--
2:9-2:18 -> lib.nvs
3:9-3:18 -> lib.nvs
